//  🛑 THE ACQUIRE PATH IS LUCKASS'S OWN QUEST, NOT A BOX WEAPON (owner, 2026-10-07:
//  "you do a quest and upgrade it to the magma gat, the same quest of the person -
//  keep it only on Mob of the Dead"). v2.15.32-42 shipped the gun everywhere the
//  253-weapon table had room and put the base form in the box; gone. His own
//  scripts now run the show: scripts\zm\zm_prison\zm_prison_magmagat.gsc (gates
//  the whole quest to zm_prison) and his .csc (the tempered gun's muzzle flame).
//  Our old behaviour twin scripts\zm\magmagat.gsc is deleted - his pack carries
//  the same weapon behavior inside his mg_weapon.gsc. The five defs his quest
//  precaches: magmagat_zm, magmagat_upgraded_zm, mg_magma_blob_zm (raw in
//  weapons\zm\) and mg_tempered_zm, mg_tempered_upgraded_zm (compiled in the
//  donor, his own bytes - see the weapons note below).
//
//  🛑 THE WEAPON DEFS ARE NOT DECLARED HERE, same rule as every other ported
//  gun: magmagat_zm (19,829 B), magmagat_upgraded_zm (19,878 B) and
//  mg_magma_blob_zm (20,371 B) ship raw in weapons\zm\ - all under the
//  20,480-byte runtime-loader ceiling with no trims needed. His Tempered
//  Blundergat pair (mg_tempered_zm 22,154 B, mg_tempered_upgraded_zm ~25 KB in
//  his Unlinker dump) is over that ceiling, so those two come as HIS compiled
//  weapon assets out of the donor, declared at the bottom of this zone.
//
//  📝 CAMO. His mod recolours with the stock camo_870mcs table, whose slots 3
//  and 12 do not map a MagmaGat material on our model set; zm_qol's own
//  camo_qol_magmagat (zone_assets\camo\, built from the blundergat/gallo
//  pattern) maps every model material except the two BO4 armour-kit materials,
//  which the Blundergat precedent leaves uncamo'd too. Both magmagat defs name
//  it; the blob is an offhand projectile nobody holds and keeps the dart's empty
//  camo field. The Tempered pair keeps HIS camo_870mcs value as shipped - the
//  gun exists for two minutes mid-quest, its tempered look is baked into his
//  mg_tempered_* models, and hooking our table onto it is a change he did not
//  make.
// ============================================================================

// the two BO4 gun pairs and the blob model; the far LODs, the lava-tank material
